OL,3,GNEWSAIraq veteran calls on government
OL,4,Afor more support
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn army veteran who was injured in Iraq
OL,7,F20 years ago is delivering a letter to
OL,8,Fthe Prime Minister calling for a
OL,9,Fgenerational shift in support for
OL,10,Fformer service personnel.
OL,12,FSimon "Si" Brown, 47, from Morley, West
OL,13,FYorkshire, was leading a rescue mission
OL,14,Fin Basra when he was shot in the face
OL,15,Fby a sniper in 2006.
OL,17,FHe is part of a group from charity Help
OL,18,Ffor Heroes handing the open letter to
OL,19,FAndy Burnham ahead of Remembrance
OL,20,FSunday, calling for better healthcare
OL,21,Fand financial security to those who
OL,22,Fhave served.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
